    "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:14:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-12-02T20:14:20Z",
    "body": "I agree that enabling handler registration inside the precommit phase would make the Navigation API more flexible. Currently, using Promise.withResolvers() adds unnecessary complexity, especially when navigation logic is conditional or evolves based on precommit results.\nA mechanism like `controller.addHandler()` would allow cleaner composition of navigation flows and reduce boilerplate. Are there any concerns around timing, ordering guarantees, or potential race conditions with dynamically added handlers?\nLooking forward to hearing implementers’ views on feasibility.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
